ENTRY            D6511   20260819   20261124   20261124       D153
SUBENT        D6511001   20260819   20261124   20261124       D153
BIB                 10         19
TITLE      Measurement of complete and incomplete fusion in
            12,13C+51V system at 5 MeV/A
AUTHOR     (S.Thakur, H.Kumawat, V.V.Parkar, A.S.Bennal)
INSTITUTE  (3INDKUD,3INDTRM)
           (3INDIND) Homi Bhabha National Institute, Mumbai
REFERENCE  (J,NP/A,1067,123290,2026)
           #doi:10.1016/j.nuclphysa.2025.123290
FACILITY   (VDGT,3INDTAT) BARC-TIFR Pelletron-LINAC facility
SAMPLE     A self-supporting target of 51V foil having a
            thickness ~550 ug/cm2 prepared by rolling
DETECTOR   (HPGE) A detector was positioned 15 cm from the target
            at an angle of 120 degree to detect gamma-rays.
           The resolution of the detector was 2.2 keV at the
            1408 keV gamma-ray of 152Eu.
ERR-ANALYS (DATA-ERR) Overall cross-section uncertainty is
            about 10%, mainly due to counting statistics and
            detection efficiency.
STATUS     (APRVD) Proof-read by H.Kumawat (2026-08-31)
HISTORY    (20260819C) A.Gandhi
ENDBIB              19
